WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.840
If the forceful coughing fails to clear the airway during mild choking, the situation

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.960
becomes severe choking.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:11.760
This is a life and death emergency where the airway is completely blocked.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.080
In this state, the victim is unable to make any sound at all.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.219
They cannot speak, breathe, or cough.

00:00:18.219 --> 00:00:23.120
You will often see them clutching their throat in the universal sign for choking, and their

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.920
skin may begin turning pale or blue as they lose oxygen.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.419
If left untreated, this leads quickly to unconsciousness and death.

00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:36.919
If you recognize these signs, you must shout for help and call 911 immediately.

